    {
      "subId": "7407601",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the final Seal",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740760101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740760101": {
            "id": "740760101",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "This is the last place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760102"
            ]
          },
          "740760102": {
            "id": "740760102",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "At least the entrance is still sealed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760103"
            ]
          },
          "740760103": {
            "id": "740760103",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Looks like Jakob hasn't answered the riddle here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760104"
            ]
          },
          "740760104": {
            "id": "740760104",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Perhaps he provided \"an\" answer, just not \"the\" answer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760105"
            ]
          },
          "740760105": {
            "id": "740760105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... The answers from before were \"shadow,\" \"life,\" and \"love.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760106"
            ]
          },
          "740760106": {
            "id": "740760106",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "Based on the previous patterns, my logic module has hypothesized the tablet inscription to be as follows:",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760107"
            ]
          },
          "740760107": {
            "id": "740760107",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "\"Always united\"... \"Born in an instant, often contradicting, I accompany you in eternal rest\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760108"
            ]
          },
          "740760108": {
            "id": "740760108",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Then the last line is \"the first droplet.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760109"
            ]
          },
          "740760109": {
            "id": "740760109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Caterpillar, Seymour, do you guys know the answer?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407602",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to everyone",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740760401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740760401": {
            "id": "740760401",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "I think I have an idea concerning \"the first droplet.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760402"
            ]
          },
          "740760402": {
            "id": "740760402",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "It sounds like it's referring to the first raindrop that fell following the creation of the world. I believe this idea was in vogue with both Ancient Fontaine and the Ordo.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760403"
            ]
          },
          "740760403": {
            "id": "740760403",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But how are we supposed to find something like that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760404"
            ]
          },
          "740760404": {
            "id": "740760404",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Well, this first droplet became part of all water in Teyvat. In that sense, every drop of water is the \"first droplet.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760405"
            ]
          },
          "740760405": {
            "id": "740760405",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "It's like the first god spreading out the potential for greatness. An element of divinity is present in every person's body.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760406"
            ]
          },
          "740760406": {
            "id": "740760406",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But if it's that simple, the person who came before us should have had no problem offering up the right answer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760407"
            ]
          },
          "740760407": {
            "id": "740760407",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Indeed. I'm probably wrong.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760408"
            ]
          },
          "740760408": {
            "id": "740760408",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Well, even if it was the wrong answer, it was a good one. I can only conclude that the person who set up these riddles had no sense of romance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760409"
            ]
          },
          "740760409": {
            "id": "740760409",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And now he's laughing at you for not getting how security works!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760410"
            ]
          },
          "740760410": {
            "id": "740760410",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "I am unable to provide an answer. My search for \"the first droplet\" retrieved 1,200 results.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760411"
            ]
          },
          "740760411": {
            "id": "740760411",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "\"Legend has it that the world's first drop of wine came to be when the Anemo God...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760413",
              "740760415"
            ]
          },
          "740760413": {
            "id": "740760413",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "Very well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760416"
            ]
          },
          "740760416": {
            "id": "740760416",
            "speakerId": 20995,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "About that... I think I have something I can share.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760417"
            ]
          },
          "740760417": {
            "id": "740760417",
            "speakerId": 20995,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "There's a legend that says that Oceanids came from the first tear shed by the previous Hydro Archon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760418"
            ]
          },
          "740760418": {
            "id": "740760418",
            "speakerId": 20995,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Meanwhile, the first tear on the earth was shed by the first Oceanid after she came to understand humanity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760419"
            ]
          },
          "740760419": {
            "id": "740760419",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wouldn't the first tear in the world have come from the first crying human baby?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760420"
            ]
          },
          "740760420": {
            "id": "740760420",
            "speakerId": 20995,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Animal tears are actually salt discharges, and in those peaceful times, humans breathed their first in laughter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760421"
            ]
          },
          "740760421": {
            "id": "740760421",
            "speakerId": 20995,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "That's what the legends say, anyway.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760422"
            ]
          },
          "740760422": {
            "id": "740760422",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "Actually, I believe that the cries of babies and animal salt discharges can be regarded as similarly unemotional behaviors.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760423"
            ]
          },
          "740760423": {
            "id": "740760423",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "Babies cry due to external stimuli, and to fill their lungs with air as quickly as possible. That is what the Sumeru Amurta textbooks say.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760424"
            ]
          },
          "740760424": {
            "id": "740760424",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is the answer an \"Oceanid\" then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760425"
            ]
          },
          "740760425": {
            "id": "740760425",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That does seem like an answer that the person before us might not have provided."
          },
          "740760415": {
            "id": "740760415",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If you're gonna flog a dead horse, let's at least go about it the right way!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407603",
      "subQuestName": "Solve the Orthant's puzzle",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740760301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740760301": {
            "id": "740760301",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "This is the last place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760302"
            ]
          },
          "740760302": {
            "id": "740760302",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Our search hasn't turned up anything so far...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760303"
            ]
          },
          "740760303": {
            "id": "740760303",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Very true. However, this entrance is shut, which means we still have a chance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760304"
            ]
          },
          "740760304": {
            "id": "740760304",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Looks like our adversary hasn't solved the riddle here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760305"
            ]
          },
          "740760305": {
            "id": "740760305",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That said, who *is* our competition, exactly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760306"
            ]
          },
          "740760306": {
            "id": "740760306",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Assuming that the Narzissenkreuz Ordo has been inactive for centuries and that the knowledge I possess of it still holds true, combined with events that occurred prior to now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760307"
            ]
          },
          "740760307": {
            "id": "740760307",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "I fear it must be Jakob.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760308"
            ]
          },
          "740760308": {
            "id": "740760308",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "That jerk who was picking on Seymour? What would he want with this stuff...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760309"
            ]
          },
          "740760309": {
            "id": "740760309",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "I'm afraid that his objective is the same as ours — to find the materials needed to forge the Holy Blade of Narzissenkreuz.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760310"
            ]
          },
          "740760310": {
            "id": "740760310",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "The Ordo was able to reproduce the four requisite hypothetical substances here in the material world, based on the esoteric philosophies of the underground kingdom and Ancient Fontaine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760311"
            ]
          },
          "740760311": {
            "id": "740760311",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "I do not understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760312"
            ]
          },
          "740760312": {
            "id": "740760312",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "These enigmatic substances are purely experiential. You could say they are even further beyond ordinary logic than elemental power.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760313"
            ]
          },
          "740760313": {
            "id": "740760313",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "I entered all introductory to intermediate level textbooks from the Akademiya's Spantamad into my memory banks decades ago. There is nothing mysterious about elemental power.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760314"
            ]
          },
          "740760314": {
            "id": "740760314",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Is that so? Anyway, to sum up, this is born of the confluence of traditions from Fontaine and technology from the ancient underground kingdom.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760315"
            ]
          },
          "740760315": {
            "id": "740760315",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "And thus, four types of substance came into being: Memory, Wish, Soul, and Persona.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760316"
            ]
          },
          "740760316": {
            "id": "740760316",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "To avoid any possible ambiguity, let's call them the \"Memory\" piece, \"Wish\" piece, \"Soul\" piece, and \"Persona\" piece.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760317"
            ]
          },
          "740760317": {
            "id": "740760317",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why are these used to make the Holy Blade?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760318"
            ]
          },
          "740760318": {
            "id": "740760318",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "In the Narzissenkreuz Ordo's brand of mystical philosophy, the temple is a microcosm of the universe, the members are stand-ins for the gods, and the holy oil is tempered willpower.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760319"
            ]
          },
          "740760319": {
            "id": "740760319",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "The Holy Blade, on the other hand, is \"reason,\" that which cuts everything open. It can only be born out of consummate human will.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760320"
            ]
          },
          "740760320": {
            "id": "740760320",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Quite abstruse.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760321"
            ]
          },
          "740760321": {
            "id": "740760321",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "That's esotericism for you. You attach yourself to anything that looks similar enough, and when this sort of thing becomes magic, fiction becomes reality.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760322"
            ]
          },
          "740760322": {
            "id": "740760322",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Either way, our adversary hasn't yet solved the riddle. Or he did, but wasn't able to provide the correct answer. With Jakob being said adversary, my bet is on the latter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760323"
            ]
          },
          "740760323": {
            "id": "740760323",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "The inscription here reads: \"Always united\"... \"Born in an instant, often contradicting, I accompany you in eternal rest\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760324"
            ]
          },
          "740760324": {
            "id": "740760324",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And the last line is \"the first droplet.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760325"
            ]
          },
          "740760325": {
            "id": "740760325",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "The areas from before had riddles like this as well. Do you guys still remember the answers?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760326"
            ]
          },
          "740760326": {
            "id": "740760326",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "\"Shadow.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760327"
            ]
          },
          "740760327": {
            "id": "740760327",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "\"Life.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760328"
            ]
          },
          "740760328": {
            "id": "740760328",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "\"Love.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760329"
            ]
          },
          "740760329": {
            "id": "740760329",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh, the answers just keep getting more abstract, don't they?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740760330"
            ]
          },
          "740760330": {
            "id": "740760330",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Caterpillar, Seymour, do you guys know the answer to this riddle?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407604",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain the \"Persona\" piece",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
